      | 4    | horas  | 2026-07-15T06:00:00 | 2026-07-15T09:00:00 | 2026-07-15T11:00:00 | 0.5      | 2026-07-15T09:00:00 |

  # Undo completion 8
  # Relative: deleting the only completion leaves it as never completed
